                      "fontSize": "9pt"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Record base teams are mapped to Business Central Services where Region, District, Service Type and Service Name are derived.  Teams with no mapping will show as Unknown or N/A. ",
